### 5. OPERATIONAL, FACTORING & REGULATORY DISCLAIMERS
5.1 **Bank Factoring & Credit Underwriting:** The Platform provides technical software infrastructure (invitation state machines, document viewer desks, and automated 3-way split payment calculations) to facilitate freight financing. The Developer is not a financial institution, credit broker, or insurer. All freight underwriting decisions, interest rates, factoring agreements, and credit recovery risks remain exclusively between the participating financial institutions and the Client/Contractors.
5.2 **Transporter Verification & Roadworthiness:** The Platform enforces digital compliance requirements (upload of driver licenses, hackney permits, GIT insurance, and truck video proofs). The Client remains solely responsible for the physical inspection, mechanical roadworthiness, cargo security, and transit safety of contracted vehicles.
5.3 **Statutory Tax & Financial Accounting:** The Platform automates calculation of Value Added Tax (VAT at 7.5%) and Withholding Tax (WHT at 5%) on brokerage and consultant fees. The Client remains solely responsible for obtaining and maintaining corporate haulage permits and timely filing of tax returns with government authorities (FIRS/NRS, SCUML).

